==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|orv|ru}} {{term|сꙋка|lang=orv}}, from {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*sǫkа}} (compare Polish {{term|suka|lang=pl}}), ultimately from a derivative of {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/'sukə/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-сука.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|су́ка|f}}

# [[bitch]] {{gloss|female dog}}
